<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for export of a 100-pound (45.36 kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean coffee, effective from December 19 to December 25 the 1996.</p>
<p>	 Washed arabic....................$ 109.67</p>
<p>	 Natural arabic...................$ 104.08</p>
<p>	 Robust natural...................$  48.69</p>
<p>	 Roasted and/or ground............$  90.90</p>
</text>
